            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "This parameter estimation model is a difficult nonconvex, nonlinear program for which no efficient solution algorithm exists to find global optima. To facilitate solution, the problem is reformulated using a MIP under-estimator and an NLP over-estimator. Information is exchanged between the two formulations, and the process is iterated until the two solutions converge.",
